.         replace pgfamstd = 1 if pgfamstd == 7 //Married LGBT
(0 real changes made)

.         replace pgfamstd = 2 if pgfamstd == 8 //Seperated LGBT
(0 real changes made)

.         
.         *Generate Total childcare Hours
.         gen geh = (pli0019_h*5) + pli0022_h + pli0044_h

. 
. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H3 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * Poisson is estimated with Gender Equity Household (GEH) ad the depe
> ndent variable.
.         * GEH is calculated by totalling up the the hours married men spend o
> n childcare in a week.
.         *       = (5 x Daily Weekday Hours) + Saturday Hours + Sunday Hours 
.         *               These were three seperate questions
.         * Controls are then included for: income, education, and year
.         * The dependent variable of interest is d_daughter, a dummy variable 
> which =1 if have a daughter 
.         * The Poisson uses a normal distribution for its p-value 
. 
.         poisson geh d_daughter plc0013_h pgbilzeit  i.syear, robust

